.env
# Backtest/screen output is generated and stays ignored — EXCEPT the pinned
# snapshot the site renders and the docs quote (see docs/REPRODUCIBILITY.md).
results/*
!results/screen_2026-04-26.json
!results/backtest_2026-04-26.csv
!results/backtest_detail_2026-04-26.csv
*.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
storage/logos/
# Regenerable data caches — auto-downloaded by data/fama_french.py and
# data/sp500_historical.py from pinned upstream sources (Dartmouth, fja05680/sp500).
storage/*.csv
# Stray screenshots dropped in the repo root by screenshot/verify tooling.
/*.png
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
